      "representation": "storage",
      "value": "<h1>Deployment Runbook</h1><p>How to ship a release to production safely.</p><h2>Pre-flight Checklist</h2><ul><li>All tests green on main</li><li>Changelog updated</li><li>On-call engineer notified</li></ul><h2>Deploy Steps</h2><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">bash</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[make release TAG=v1.2.3\nmake deploy ENV=production]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"warning\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>Never deploy on a Friday afternoon without sign-off.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2>Rollback</h2><p>If metrics degrade, run the rollback command and page the <a href=\"/spaces/ENG/pages/1001\">on-call rotation</a>.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Signal</th><th>Threshold</th><th>Action</th></tr><tr><td>Error rate</td><td>&gt; 2%</td><td>Rollback</td></tr><tr><td>p95 latency</td><td>&gt; 10s</td><td>Investigate</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    }
  },
